# Copy to web/.env.local (git-ignored). Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_.

# Optional: address search (Adressevælgeren) and the fallback basemap
# (GeoDanmark Skaermkort via Datafordeler's WMS, used only if the OpenFreeMap
# vector basemap fails) both use this. Without it the fallback is
# OpenStreetMap's raster tiles and address search returns nothing. A plain API-Key (not an
# OAuth Shared Secret -- that one must never ship in client code) from an
# IT-system in Datafordeler Administration (portal.datafordeler.dk/hjem ->
# your IT-system -> "API-Keys" -> Opret). Same root credentials family as
# DATAFORDELER_CLIENT_ID/SECRET in the repo-root .env.example, but this is a
# separate, deliberately-public-safe key -- it is meant to be visible in the
# shipped client bundle, unlike the pipeline's OAuth secret.
VITE_DATAFORDELER_API_KEY=

# Optional: Sentry error monitoring. Left blank, the SDK is a no-op. In CI this
# comes from the VITE_SENTRY_DSN Actions variable; source maps upload only when
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN is also present.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
